Third-party components

The code of this repository is under the MIT license above. The pieces below
come from other projects and keep their own licenses:

- Ultralytics, the library that runs the detector, and the detector weights
  `bee11n.pt` of the Beehaviour project (J. Calsina, L. Santamaria, G. Biosca
  and V. Abello, UPC) are under AGPL-3.0. The weights are not in this
  repository; the README explains how to download them. Anyone who distributes a
  program that uses them has to follow the AGPL-3.0 terms.
- The image `results/sample_detections.jpg` and the panel (b) of
  `assets/prototype-and-detections.jpg` come from the dataset of Sledevic and
  Matuzevicius, "Labeled dataset for bee detection and direction estimation on
  entrance to beehive", Data in Brief, vol. 52, 2024
  (doi:10.1016/j.dib.2024.110060), under CC BY 4.0.
